                   Metagraphics Demonstration Programs

The Metagraphics "METAGRAF" directory contains two subdirectories,
MWDEMO and FWDEMO.  The subdirectories contain demonstration programs
of Metagraphics MetaWINDOW(tm) and FontWINDOW(tm) graphics
programming tools for Borland C/C++ and Pascal.


-MWDEMO- Metagraphics MetaWINDOW(tm) Demo

Directory MWDEMO contains a demonstration program of Metagraphics
MetaWINDOW graphics development tools for use with Borland C/C++ and
Pascal.  You can execute the MetaWINDOW demo program directly from
the subdirectory, or copy all the files to a local directory.  Execute
MWDEMO to start the demo program.


-FWDEMO- Metagraphics FontWINDOW(tm) Demo

Directory FWDEMO contains a demonstration program of Metagraphics
FontWINDOW development tools for use Metagraphics MetaWINDOW product
and Borland C/C++ and Pascal compilers.  You can execute the
FontWINDOW demo program directly from the subdirectory, or copy all
the files to a local directory.  Execute FONTDEMO to start the demo
program.


